SUMMARY:Tubing the Grand River
DESCRIPTION:Wilderness Union Toronto - Outdoor Adventure and Hiking Club\n
 **Please note the only way to register for this adventure is on [our websi
 te.](https://www.wildernessunion.com/adventures/tubing-the-grand-river-26)
 **\n\n**This is one of our most popular adventures every year: sweet summe
 rtime relaxation through the beautiful Grand River. Just lay back\, enjoy 
 and let the current take you along this scenic journey.**\n\nLife along th
 e Grand River moves at a pace that invites you to disconnect from city str
 ess and be present. This 5 km float from Five Oaks to Brant Park runs enti
 rely through a natural corridor: no shops\, no crowds and no paddling requ
 ired if the current's running well. The water is shallow with a gentle cur
 rent and a gravel bottom\, so it's a solid first river experience even if 
 you've never done anything like it before.\n\nTubes take most people aroun
 d 2 hours\, with plenty of spots along the way to hop off for a swim. We w
 rap up the day with a group picnic lunch at Brant Park once you're off the
  water.\n\nBring shoes you don't mind getting wet\, sunscreen\, and snacks
 . This will be a sun filled day to remember!\n\n**Highlights**\n**Tubing t
 he Grand:** Kick back and let the current do the work. The Grand River's e
 asy flow and shallow gravel bottom make for a laid-back float that anyone 
 can enjoy\n**Picnic lunch at Brant Park:** The float ends at Brant Park Co
 nservation Area\, where we pull out our packed lunches and decompress h in
  the shade.\n**River Swimming:** Plenty of spots to pull over and jump in 
 along the way. On a warm day\, it's hard to stay in the tube.\n\n**Event c
 ost: $75+HST - $50 optional transport available.**\n**Register [here.](htt
 ps://www.wildernessunion.com/adventures/tubing-the-grand-river-26)**\n\n**
 About Wilderness Union**\nWilderness Union is deliberate about building an
  outdoors community that connects you to the life-changing magic of the ou
 tdoors and helps you find your people.\n\nMembers range from 20-40 years o
 ld. The group is a mix of GTA locals and newcomers to Toronto from within 
 Canada and abroad.\n\nAttendance numbers on Meetup don't reflect our actua
 l event attendance - we typically have 15-20 community members at each eve
 nt. Large enough that there's someone new to meet but small enough that it
 's not overwhelming!\n\n***Learn more at our website [www.wildernessunion.
 com](https://www.wildernessunion.com/)***
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/wildernessunion/events/315297343/
